flowchart TD
  Markdown["Markdown + arbitrary frontmatter"]
  OtherArtifact["Media / code / EDN / diagram / other artifact"]
  External["GitHub / clock / tool / person / external event"]

  Adapter["Adapter parses source into Clojure data"]
  Alpha["α Alpha validates asserted contracts"]
  Artifact["Validated Artifact + typed Relations"]
  Event["Normalized Event"]
  Clio["Clio append-only facts / causal history"]
  Match["Rheos matches declarative Reaction"]
  Condition{"Condition holds?"}
  Invoke["Invoke typed Operation / Workflow"]
  Outcome["Artifacts + contributions + receipts"]
  Projection["Π projections / views / products"]
  Finding["Structural finding; no silent pass"]

  Markdown --> Adapter
  OtherArtifact --> Adapter
  Adapter --> Alpha
  Alpha -->|valid| Artifact
  Alpha -->|invalid| Finding

  Artifact --> Event
  External --> Event
  Event --> Clio
  Event --> Match --> Condition
  Condition -->|no| Clio
  Condition -->|yes| Invoke
  Invoke --> Outcome
  Outcome --> Clio
  Outcome --> Projection
  Outcome --> Event
